  "id": "avm",
  "term": "AVM",
  "definition": "AVM refers to around view monitoring, a vehicle system that uses four wide-angle cameras to capture the area around the vehicle. In this source, AVM images are used to help detect nearby obstacles and estimate how far they are from the vehicle.",
